==French==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|minus|lang=la}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-moins.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|lang=fr|/mwɛ̃/}}, {{SAMPA|lang=fr|/mwE~/}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[less]]
#: ''Faites '''moins''' de bruit.'' — “Make less noise.”
#: ''J'ai '''moins''' de thé que toi.'' — "I have '''less''' tea than you."
#: ''J'ai '''moins''' de thé que de café.'' — "I have '''less''' tea than coffee." 
#: ''J'ai dû attendre '''moins''' que dix minutes.'' — "I had to wait '''less''' than ten minutes."
# {{context|with numbers}} [[minus]]; [[negative]]
#: '''''moins''' cinq'' — “minus five”
# {{context|preceded by a [[definite article]]}} the [[least]]
#: ''Il gagne le '''moins''' d'argent dans sa famille.'' — “He earns the least money in his family.”
#: ''C'était la chose la '''moins''' surprenante.'' — “It was the least surprising thing.”

====Antonyms====
